#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How Ditana configures atomic snapshots around system upgrades, and how to roll back from the rescue system."
msgstr "Co che Ditana configurescha snapshots atomars enturn las actualisaziuns dal sistem, e co restaurar in snapshot ord il sistem da salvament."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic system snapshots"
msgstr "Snapshots automatics dal sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"Ditana takes an automatic snapshot of the system state prior to a system "
"upgrade, through a pacman hook. This is configured independently of the "
"chosen filesystem under **Advanced Settings → System Maintenance Tools → "
"Configure Automatic System Snapshots** in the installer (enabled by default)."
msgstr ""
"Ditana fa, cun agid d’in hook da pacman, in snapshot automatic dal stadi dal "
"sistem avant in’actualisaziun dal sistem. Quai vegn configurà "
"independentamain dal sistem da datotecas tschernì sut **Advanced Settings → "
"System Maintenance Tools → Configure Automatic System Snapshots** en "
"l’installatur (activà sco standard)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"How frequently that occurs varies. On **ZFS** each upgrade is preceded by a "
"snapshot. On **BTRFS**, **XFS** and **EXT4**, `timeshift-autosnap` takes at "
"most one snapshot every 18 hours (`minHoursBetweenSnapshots` in `/etc/"
"timeshift-autosnap.conf`), so a second upgrade on the same day does not "
"trigger a new one. Either way, three are kept (`maxSnapshots`)."
msgstr ""
"La frequenza variescha. Sin **ZFS** vegn fatg in snapshot avant mintga "
"actualisaziun. Sin **BTRFS**, **XFS** ed **EXT4** fa `timeshift-autosnap` il "
"pli in snapshot mintga 18 uras (`minHoursBetweenSnapshots` en `/etc/"
"timeshift-autosnap.conf`), uschia che ina segunda actualisaziun il medem di "
"na producescha betg in nov snapshot. En mintga cas vegnan conservads trais "
"snapshots (`maxSnapshots`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"On **ZFS** and **BTRFS**, snapshots are atomic — captured at a single "
"instant, with negligible storage and time overhead. On **XFS** and **EXT4**, "
"Timeshift is used in rsync mode; the initial snapshot is the slowest one, "
"and subsequent snapshots typically complete in under five seconds."
msgstr ""
"Sin **ZFS** e **BTRFS** èn ils snapshots atomars – fatgs en in unic mument, "
"cun in impundiment da memoria e da temp negligibel. Sin **XFS** ed **EXT4** "
"vegn Timeshift utilisà en il modus rsync; l’emprim snapshot è il pli plaun, "
"ed ils snapshots suandants èn per regla terminads en main che tschintg "
"secundas."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"The installer itself captures the first snapshot, just prior to the first "
"reboot, ensuring there is a clean baseline from day one – you can roll back "
"to \"freshly installed\" without having ever done an upgrade first. On ZFS "
"that baseline does not last: it is named like every other automatic snapshot "
"and is the oldest, so the retention limit sweeps it up after three upgrades. "
"Rename it, or raise `maxSnapshots`, if you want to keep it. Under Timeshift "
"it survives, because the deletion filter does not match it."
msgstr ""
"L’installatur sez fa l’emprim snapshot, gist avant l’emprim reaviar, uschia "
"ch’i dat dapi l’emprim di in punct da partenza net – Vus pudais restaurar il "
"stadi «gist installà» senza avair fatg avant in’actualisaziun. Sin ZFS na "
"dura quest punct da partenza betg: el ha in num sco mintga auter snapshot "
"automatic ed è il pli vegl, perquai vegn el stizzà da la limita da "
"conservaziun suenter trais actualisaziuns. Renumnai quest snapshot u "
"augmentai `maxSnapshots`, sche Vus vulais conservar el. Cun Timeshift resta "
"el, perquai ch’el na correspunda betg al filter da stizzar."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Snapshots are system-only.** Your home directory and other data volumes are not included. Restoring a system snapshot does not touch your personal files — roll back the system, keep your work.\n"
msgstr "**Ils snapshots cumpiglian mo il sistem.** Voss ordinatur persunal ed auters volumens da datas n’èn betg integrads. La restauraziun d’in snapshot dal sistem na tutga betg Vossas datotecas persunalas – restaurai il sistem, mantegnai Vossa lavur.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edge case: rolling back to the installer's snapshot"
msgstr "Cas spezial: restaurar il snapshot da l’installatur"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"If you roll back to the very first snapshot taken at the end of "
"installation, one minor consequence: the first-boot Flatpak deployment "
"service (`ditana-flatpak-finalize.service`) will run again during the next "
"boot, reinstalling the Flatpaks you initially chose. It is scheduled prior "
"to the login screen and intentionally delays it while it downloads, so a "
"boot that sits on a text console for a while is the expected behaviour and "
"not a hang. This is by design – those Flatpaks are part of the configured "
"system, so they are reinstated alongside everything else. Subsequent "
"rollbacks (to snapshots after first-boot completion) do not exhibit this."
msgstr ""
"Sche Vus restaurais l’emprim snapshot, fatg a la fin da l’installaziun, ha "
"quai ina pitschna consequenza: il servetsch che installescha ils Flatpaks a "
"l’emprim aviar (`ditana-flatpak-finalize.service`) vegn exequì anc ina giada "
"durant il proxim aviar e reinstallescha ils Flatpaks che Vus avais tschernì "
"a l’entschatta. El è planisà avant il visur d’annunzia e retardescha quel "
"intenziunadamain durant ch’el telechargia, perquai è in aviar che resta in "
"temp sin ina consola da text il cumportament spetgà e betg ina bloccada dal "
"sistem. Quai è uschia previs – quests Flatpaks fan part dal sistem "
"configurà, perquai vegnan els restaurads ensemen cun tut il rest. "
"Restauraziuns suandantas (da snapshots fatgs suenter la fin da l’emprim "
"aviar) n’han betg quest effect."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ZFS lock file handling"
msgstr "Gestiun da la datoteca da bloccada sin ZFS"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"Ditana ships its own [zfs-autosnap](https://github.com/acrion/zfs-autosnap) "
"fork, which moves the pacman lock file (`/var/lib/pacman/db.lck`) aside at "
"the moment the snapshot is taken and puts it back afterwards, so that the "
"snapshot contains no lock file. This means a ZFS rollback leaves you with a "
"usable pacman immediately — no manual `rm /var/lib/pacman/db.lck` step. The "
"upstream Timeshift variant for non-ZFS filesystems does not handle this, "
"which is why the Timeshift recovery procedure below includes that manual "
"step."
msgstr ""
"Ditana furnescha ses agen fork da [zfs-autosnap](https://github.com/acrion/"
"zfs-autosnap) che metta da la vart la datoteca da bloccada da pacman (`/var/"
"lib/pacman/db.lck`) en il mument ch’il snapshot vegn fatg e metta lura la "
"datoteca puspè en ses lieu, uschia ch’il snapshot na cuntegna nagina "
"datoteca da bloccada. Quai munta che Vus avais suenter ina restauraziun ZFS "
"immediatamain in pacman utilisabel – senza il pass manual `rm /var/lib/"
"pacman/db.lck`. La varianta d’origin da Timeshift per sistems da datotecas "
"auters che ZFS na resguarda betg quai, perquai cuntegna la procedura da "
"restauraziun cun Timeshift qua sutvart quest pass manual."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recovery procedure"
msgstr "Procedura da restauraziun"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"On ZFS there is a shorter route that needs no medium at all. ZFSBootMenu can "
"boot a snapshot directly: interrupt it at startup, pick the boot "
"environment, and choose the snapshot you want from the list it shows. The "
"installer's own baseline is called `autosnap_after_ditana_installation`. "
"Everything below is for the case where that is not enough, or for a "
"filesystem other than ZFS."
msgstr ""
"Sin ZFS exista ina via pli curta che na dovra insumma nagin medium. "
"ZFSBootMenu po aviar directamain in snapshot: interrumpai ZFSBootMenu durant "
"l’aviar, selecziunai il boot environment e tscherni il snapshot giavischà da "
"la glista ch’el mussa. Il punct da partenza da l’installatur sez sa numna "
"`autosnap_after_ditana_installation`. Tut quai che suonda qua sutvart è per "
"il cas che quai na basta betg, u per in auter sistem da datotecas che ZFS."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"If your system fails to boot, boot from the Ditana ISO. It asks whether it "
"should enter the rescue system for the installation it discovered; respond "
"with yes, and it mounts the installed system and lists the snapshots it "
"holds. The commands below are what you run inside that rescue system – not "
"in the bare live environment, which has neither Timeshift nor the imported "
"pool."
msgstr ""
"Sche Voss sistem na po betg vegnir avià, aviai da l’ISO da Ditana. El "
"dumonda sch’el duai entrar en il sistem da salvament per l’installaziun "
"ch’el ha chattà; respundai cun gea, ed el montescha il sistem installà e "
"mussa ils snapshots ch’el cuntegna. Ils cumonds qua sutvart exequis Vus en "
"quest sistem da salvament – betg en l’ambient live simpel che n’ha ni "
"Timeshift ni il pool importà."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ZFS"
msgstr "ZFS"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid "List available snapshots:"
msgstr "Mussai ils snapshots disponibels:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "zfs list -t snapshot\n"
msgstr "zfs list -t snapshot\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid "Example output:"
msgstr "Exempel da sortida:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"NAME                                                    USED  AVAIL  REFER  MOUNTPOINT\n"
"ditana-root/ROOT/default@autosnap_2026-05-19_23-14-41   453K      -  3.96G  -\n"
"ditana-root/ROOT/default@autosnap_2026-05-19_23-25-28   394K      -  3.96G  -\n"
"ditana-root/ROOT/default@autosnap_2026-05-19_23-26-06  1.05M      -  3.96G  -\n"
msgstr ""
"NAME                                                    USED  AVAIL  REFER  MOUNTPOINT\n"
"ditana-root/ROOT/default@autosnap_2026-05-19_23-14-41   453K      -  3.96G  -\n"
"ditana-root/ROOT/default@autosnap_2026-05-19_23-25-28   394K      -  3.96G  -\n"
"ditana-root/ROOT/default@autosnap_2026-05-19_23-26-06  1.05M      -  3.96G  -\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid "Restore a specific snapshot:"
msgstr "Restaurai in snapshot determinà:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo zfs rollback ditana-root/ROOT/default@autosnap_2026-05-19_23-26-06\n"
msgstr "sudo zfs rollback ditana-root/ROOT/default@autosnap_2026-05-19_23-26-06\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"`zfs rollback` refuses while newer snapshots exist, which is the normal case "
"once several have accumulated. Destroy them first, or pass `-r` to have it "
"destroy them for you – everything newer than the snapshot you are restoring "
"is gone either way."
msgstr ""
"`zfs rollback` refusa da restaurar, uschè ditg che snapshots pli novs "
"existan, quai ch’è il cas normal, uschespert che plirs snapshots èn "
"s’accumulads. Stizzai quels snapshots avant, u agiuntai l’opziun `-r`, "
"uschia ch’il cumond stizza quels snapshots per Vus – tut quai ch’è pli nov "
"ch’il snapshot che Vus restaurais è en mintga cas pers."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "BTRFS, XFS, EXT4"
msgstr "BTRFS, XFS, EXT4"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"Automatic snapshots are managed by `timeshift-autosnap`, which creates a "
"snapshot before every full upgrade."
msgstr ""
"Ils snapshots automatics vegnan administrads da `timeshift-autosnap` che fa "
"in snapshot avant mintga actualisaziun cumpletta."

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo timeshift --list\n"
msgstr "sudo timeshift --list\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Mounted '/dev/dm-0 (sda4)' at '/run/timeshift/195216/backup'\n"
"Device : /dev/dm-0 (sda4)\n"
"Mode   : RSYNC\n"
"\n"
"Num Name                Tags  Description\n"
"------------------------------------------\n"
"0 > 2026-05-19_18-04-37 0     after installation of Ditana GNU/Linux\n"
msgstr ""
"Mounted '/dev/dm-0 (sda4)' at '/run/timeshift/195216/backup'\n"
"Device : /dev/dm-0 (sda4)\n"
"Mode   : RSYNC\n"
"\n"
"Num Name                Tags  Description\n"
"------------------------------------------\n"
"0 > 2026-05-19_18-04-37 0     after installation of Ditana GNU/Linux\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid "Restore a snapshot:"
msgstr "Restaurai in snapshot:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo timeshift --restore --snapshot 2026-05-19_18-04-37\n"
msgstr "sudo timeshift --restore --snapshot 2026-05-19_18-04-37\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"When prompted, **do not reinstall GRUB2** as Timeshift recommends — it "
"assumes the presence of an `update-grub` tool that Ditana does not use. If "
"you need to update GRUB after restoration, run:"
msgstr ""
"Cura che Timeshift As dumonda, **na reinstallai betg GRUB2**, er sche "
"Timeshift recumonda quai – el premetta in utensil `update-grub` che Ditana "
"n’utilisescha betg. Sche Vus stuais actualisar GRUB suenter la restauraziun, "
"exequi:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "grub-mkconfig -o /boot/grub/grub.cfg\n"
msgstr "grub-mkconfig -o /boot/grub/grub.cfg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid "After a Timeshift restore, also clear the pacman database lock:"
msgstr ""
"Suenter ina restauraziun cun Timeshift, stizzai er la bloccada da la banca "
"da datas da pacman:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo rm /var/lib/pacman/db.lck\n"
msgstr "sudo rm /var/lib/pacman/db.lck\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/automatic-system-snapshots.md
msgid ""
"This is required because `timeshift-autosnap` (the upstream project for non-"
"ZFS filesystems) captures the pacman lock file as part of the snapshot. "
"Ditana's [zfs-autosnap fork](https://github.com/acrion/zfs-autosnap) removes "
"the lock file before snapshotting, which is why the equivalent step is "
"unnecessary on ZFS (`zfs rollback` is sufficient)."
msgstr ""
"Quai è necessari perquai che `timeshift-autosnap` (il project d’origin per "
"sistems da datotecas auters che ZFS) registrescha la datoteca da bloccada da "
"pacman sco part dal snapshot. Il [fork da zfs-autosnap](https://github.com/"
"acrion/zfs-autosnap) da Ditana allontanescha la datoteca da bloccada avant "
"ch’il snapshot vegn fatg, perquai n’è il pass correspundent betg necessari "
"sin ZFS (`zfs rollback` basta)."
